{
  "sock_buf_size": 16777216,
  "log_level": "info",
  "_comment_allow_unverified_transport": "This demo config includes rules with verify:none to non-loopback upstreams and a non-mutual decrypt listener. Those are a preflight ERROR (fail --validate) by default; this opt-in downgrades them to warnings so the illustrative config still validates. Do NOT set this in production unless you accept unverified transport.",
